# p2-relief.drv - Phase 2 tour: a rocky moon's relief on the system map (W4).
#
# Verifies: W4 crater bowls and ground relief on a rocky body (model word
# $7e), the start system's rocky moon, drawn by the HD map.
# Run:  tools/p2shots --routes relief --base BASE --branch BRANCH
# Expect: 01 the map zoomed in seven times on the moon, day side to the
#         left, the terminator down the middle; 02 zoomed in twice more:
#         the ground between the model's crater discs mottled by low ridges
#         (base: one flat colour); 03 the same view 0.5 s later (no
#         swimming). The moon has no crater circles of its own, so it shows
#         the ground relief alone.
# Start 1 (landed), new game only. Each shot pauses the game (Esc); the
# pointer is parked off the controls so no hover tip is drawn.

wait 6000
key space
wait 2000
key 1             # start position 1: landed
wait 11000
# F2, F2: the system map; pick the rocky moon, then zoom in (F7).
sdlkey f2
wait 2500
sdlkey f2
wait 2500
mouse 178 55
wait 300
click 200
wait 1500
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
mouse 2 120
wait 300
sdlkey esc
wait 500
shot 01-map-x7
sdlkey f1 shift
wait 300
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
sdlkey f7
wait 1500
mouse 2 120
wait 300
sdlkey esc
wait 500
shot 02-map-x9
sdlkey f1 shift
wait 500
sdlkey esc
wait 500
shot 03-map-x9-0.5s
sdlkey f1 shift
wait 300
quit
